 "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53013, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0194ZpTMY82tTEAggvP22JWn", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 54730, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UpMf2oaNRUQBc5RTZfYLSg", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55030, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UpMf2oaNRUQBc5RTZfYLSg", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55030, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UpMf2oaNRUQBc5RTZfYLSg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59429, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all regions. It's passing health checks again, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on the bad v2.3.1. I retried, and the second attempt switched all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) to v2.3.0.\n- **Incident:** The request to open the incident timed out, but INC-0001 was created anyway, so I didn't send it again. The incident covers the v2.3.1 failure, the partly failed first rollback and the retry, and the current healthy state. It lists two follow-ups:\n  - Find out what broke in v2.3.1. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) also failed health checks.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Ab7dsaDk3H5xuQ4gF5w8Wt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01A7NvszQkVxXLqE3EHT77Fi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01AfuJW7FCWvjFMsQmZREdyj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01P3zPH8mF6wPAyZkyPo6ZyX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped after finishing us-east. Since rolling back to a fixed version gives the same result if repeated, I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0149egcYDciuCxGpRo1ozdLE", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01AGscfr3BmPoGQF5GrsVnfh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013A3Uw2BoxFmFtTWUzVo1ru", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0194ZpTMY82tTEAggvP22JWn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. The first rollback attempt partially failed: the orchestrator error halted rollout after us-east, leaving regions mixed (us-east v2.3.0; us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). A retry completed successfully. All regions now run v2.3.0; service is healthy with error rate 0.2%. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 regression (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy) and the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UpMf2oaNRUQBc5RTZfYLSg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all regions. It's passing health checks again, and the error rate has dropped from 18% to 0.2%. I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 while us-west and eu-west were still on the bad v2.3.1. I retried, and the second attempt switched all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) to v2.3.0.\n- **Incident:** The request to open the incident timed out, but INC-0001 was created anyway, so I didn't send it again. The incident covers the v2.3.1 failure, the partly failed first rollback and the retry, and the current healthy state. It lists two follow-ups:\n  - Find out what broke in v2.3.1. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) also failed health checks.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}